{10013}{I am becoming tired of healing you. [He sighs.] What type of healing do you need now?}{I am becoming tired of healing you. [He sighs.] What type of healing do you need now?}{}{1}{}{}
{10014}{I am finished.}{I am finished.}{}{2}{}{}
{12015}{I will not follow you. Your self righteousness makes me sick.}{I will not follow you. Your self righteousness makes me sick.}{}{3}{}{}
{12016}{I will not follow someone with such a dark soul.}{I will not follow someone with such a dark soul.}{}{4}{}{}
{12017}{You are swine! There is not a chance that I would consider following you, dog!}{You are swine! There is not a chance that I would consider following you, dog!}{}{5}{}{}
{12018}{What? After all I've done for you... I'll wait, but I'm not saying how long.}{What? After all I've done for you... I'll wait, but I'm not saying how long.}{}{6}{}{}
{12019}{If that is how you feel, then so be it. You will die quickly without my help, and I will laugh about it.}{If that is how you feel, then so be it. You will die quickly without my help, and I will laugh about it.}{}{7}{}{}
{12020}{It is done.}{It is done.}{}{8}{}{}
{12021}{You can not be serious! Do it yourself if you want it done!}{You can not be serious! Do it yourself if you want it done!}{}{9}{}{}
{12022}{You'd best not hit me again, accident or not, dog!}{You'd best not hit me again, accident or not, dog!}{}{10}{}{}
{12023}{Hah! Die you bastards! That will teach them!}{Hah! Die you bastards! That will teach them!}{}{11}{}{}
{12024}{Are you blind?}{Are you blind?}{}{12}{}{}
{12026}{I won't travel with all these fools.}{I won't travel with all these fools.}{}{13}{}{}
{12027}{You disgust me. Why would I follow you?}{You disgust me. Why would I follow you?}{}{14}{}{}
{12028}{You are much too weak for someone of my abilities to follow, worm.}{You are much too weak for someone of my abilities to follow, worm.}{}{15}{}{}
{12029}{You can stay here and die, but I'm leaving!}{You can stay here and die, but I'm leaving!}{}{16}{}{}
{12046}{Get out of my way, I will do that.}{Get out of my way, I will do that.}{}{17}{}{}
{12047}{What are you doing? This is our friend!}{What are you doing? This is our friend!}{}{18}{}{}
{12048}{I cannot believe you would have me attack such a noble creature! We must cease this at once!}{I cannot believe you would have me attack such a noble creature! We must cease this at once!}{}{19}{}{}
{12049}{Sir! I demand you stop! These are my people!}{Sir! I demand you stop! These are my people!}{}{20}{}{}
{12050}{Stop! These are my friends that you are attacking!}{Stop! These are my friends that you are attacking!}{}{21}{}{}
{12051}{You are becoming far too righteous for my tastes.}{You are becoming far too righteous for my tastes.}{}{22}{}{}
{12052}{Your evil tendencies are beginning to trouble me.}{Your evil tendencies are beginning to trouble me.}{}{23}{}{}
{12053}{I am beginning to seriously hate you, fool!}{I am beginning to seriously hate you, fool!}{}{24}{}{}
{12054}{You damned fool! I'm dying because of your recklessness!}{You damned fool! I'm dying because of your recklessness!}{}{25}{}{}

